5, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 21% of normal in April to May and 128% in October to November. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 180% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2013, and grid 21032 got 23% of normal that year.</p>"}
